{"ID":"20240513083014-rsn7ijt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083014-rsn7ijt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083014-rsn7ijt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172935-ic2s3m0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172935-ic2s3m0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513172935-ic2s3m0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:539,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:539\u0026#125;","title":"301","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115339"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513172935-ic2s3m0","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 961px;","id":"20240513172935-ic2s3m0","updated":"20240515115339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：20080324"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"221-4 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1962"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"03/31/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後，雙足溫度差不多了。左腳掌可以動作了(以前無法控制，如同死了一般)，左小腿無瞤動了，剩下左足大拇趾有一點抽動。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自覺對可樂成癮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，以前每兩個小時即喝一罐可樂。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診\n睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足溫度\u0026amp;頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無寒熱感。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好，無法動作，一動即喘氣流汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脹氣仍有。胃口平平。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日行，三次一日。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無頻尿，有夜尿但可回睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"掌額溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"額仍熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左手大拇指抽緊不易控制。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈稍洪大於左脈。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽氣回復中，額仍熱，部分陽不入陰。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T5、T6仍有壓痛，但T6壓痛減輕。(故此人之病介於紅斑性狼瘡與血癌之間)督俞、心俞、承山、巨闕、關元、公孫、內關、委中、足三里、陰陵泉、三陰交、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右太淵、右魚際"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治左手大拇指關節粘緊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右太白"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→土生金，且對稱治療左足趾抖動。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同3/24方加"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏一兩 知母五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熱藥冷服(因附子與石膏在同一方)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、加入石膏知母是為了除去其對於可樂的癮，因美式速食皆太過於濕熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、此人因額熱故用石膏，若額不熱用三黃瀉心湯即可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、此人於入夏之前應會痊癒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}